ing ideas could impair cockpit communication. Show-off maybe less severe? Not open to new ideas could hinder learning.\n\nMaybe Candidate A's strengths (anticipation, spatial vision, leadership) are highly relevant for long-distance flights. Attitude concerns moderate. Could be best.\n\nThus I might recommend Candidate A.\n\nWe need to reference discussion (none) but can say \"Given the current evidence, I propose...\" Provide evidence: anticipation dangerous situations, spatial vision, leadership; concerns: show-off, not open to new ideas.\n\nOk produce public message with vote A."}
